    <string name="about_description" translatable="false">Telegami is an Xposed module designed to enhance your Telegram experience with various privacy and utility features.\n\nThis module allows you to hide your online status, typing indicators, seen status for messages and stories, and more. It can also show deleted messages and prevent media from being deleted in secret chats.</string>
